{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">旺角有住宅單位發生火警，消防在單位救出3貓2狗，全部死亡，無人受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.MK-0000_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026YJSqpmSjGC1784842506.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIRE.MK-0000_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">消防員接報到場並將火救熄。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">消防員接報到場並將火救熄。警方在昨晚九時許接到多人報案，指通菜街有住宅單位起火。初步調查後，懷疑是冷氣機短路起火，52人疏散到安全地方。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.MK-0000_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026ELMHAlHUMf1784842515.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIRE.MK-0000_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">單位內其中一隻小貓被困，由消防員救出並為牠急救，愛護動物協會派員到場處理，其後證實單位內所有貓狗死亡。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T21:58:06.155265+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}